<!--
  The status-bar glyph.

  Android renders a small icon as a monochrome mask: every non-transparent
  pixel becomes the notification tint, so a full-colour launcher logo would
  arrive as a solid white blob. This is a purpose-built single-path shield,
  drawn at the platform's 24dp status-bar size. The official NEXA launcher
  icon is a separate asset and is untouched.
-->
